// verilator.flags — options of the sram SV lint on standard hosts (lint_sram.py passes them
// with -f; the top, the -G parameter overrides and the file list are added per configuration,
// see `lint_sram.py --list`). Waivers: verilator_waivers.vlt (passed after this file, so the
// RTL is not touched) and the few existing lint_off pragmas in the leaves (waivers.md).
--lint-only
-Wall
-Wno-DECLFILENAME
